FlashAttention backward kernel中的recomputation流程：
```
// Backward kernel: 利用前向保存的O, m, l计算梯度
__global__ void flash_attn_bwd_kernel(Q, K, V, O, dO, m, l, dQ, dK, dV, ...) {
    // Grid: (T_r, batch*heads) 或 (T_c, batch*heads)，取决于实现
    // Step 1: recompute P_ij from saved stats
    // L_i = m_i + ln(l_i) — stored from fwd (1 scalar per row)
    for each (i,j) block pair:
        S_ij = Q_i @ K_j.T                    // Recompute attention scores in SRAM
        float L_i = m_i + logf(l_i);           // Retrieve LogSumExp (saved, 1 scalar)
        P_ij = exp(S_ij - L_i)                 // Recover softmax probs (NO HBM read!)

    // Step 2: compute gradients
        // dV: dV_j += P_ij.T @ dO_i           (standard)
        // dP_ij = dO_i @ V_j.T                (standard)
        // dS_ij = P_ij * (dP_ij - rowsum(dP_ij * P_ij))  (softmax backward)
        // dQ_i += dS_ij @ K_j                 (standard)
        // dK_j += dS_ij.T @ Q_i               (standard)
}
```
整个重计算在SRAM中进行，S_ij和P_ij的重计算使用了forward pass同样路径（BMM1→apply LogSumExp），所需的Q/K/V/O从HBM加载一次，L_i是单个float（O(N) storage vs O(N²)）。对比标准方法：从HBM读取N×N矩阵P（2GB for N=1024），FlashAttention用~6KB的L_i和少量的Q/K/V tile HBM reads代替了2GB的HBM read。

