FlashAttention的tiling策略与block size选择（A100, M=192KB SRAM, d=64, FP16）：
```
计算: 每个element = 2B (FP16)
      K_j tile: B_c * d * 2B
      V_j tile: B_c * d * 2B
      Q_i tile: B_r * d * 2B
      S_ij:     B_r * B_c * 2B
      P_ij:     B_r * B_c * 2B  (可复用S_ij空间)

总SRAM需求 ≈ (2*B_c*d + B_r*d + B_r*B_c) * 2B ≤ M

约束: B_c * d * 4B (K_ij+V_j) + B_r * d * 2B (Q_i) + B_r * B_c * 2B (S/P) ≤ 192KB

选择: B_c ≈ M/(4d) = 192KB/(4*64*2B) ≈ 384
      B_r = min(384, d=64) = 64  (被head_dim bound)

Tiling配置: T_r = ceil(1024/64) = 16 Q blocks, T_c = ceil(1024/384) = 3 KV blocks
HBM passes: 每个KV block需要遍历所有Q blocks → 3 * 16 = 48 block pairs
每个block pair: load K_j+V_j (2*384*64*2B=98KB) + Q_i (64*64*2B=8KB) 
               + write O_i (64*64*2B=8KB) ≈ 114KB HBM traffic
Total HBM traffic ≈ 48 * 114KB ≈ 5.5MB (forward only)
vs standard: Nd+N²+... ≈ 1024*64*2B*2 (Q,K) + 1024²*2B*2 (S,P) ≈ 8.4MB → flash is lower
```

